Zodat vele, vele zielen...

1172
02:30:40.090 --> 02:30:41.090
Zal beschermd worden.

1173
02:30:41.090 --> 02:30:42.090
Zal beschermd worden.

1174
02:30:42.090 --> 02:30:43.090
Halleluja.

1175
02:30:43.090 --> 02:30:44.090
En de leukheid te ervaren.

1176
02:30:44.090 --> 02:30:45.090
Halleluja.

1177
02:30:46.090 --> 02:30:47.090
Halleluja.

1178
02:30:48.090 --> 02:30:49.090
Oké.

1179
02:30:50.090 --> 02:30:51.090
Even goed luisteren allemaal.

1180
02:30:51.090 --> 02:30:52.090
Luister goed allemaal hè.

1181
